                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a4679b5-b681-4b68-a19c-36e4b7ded821",
                        "source_entry_id": "ce130a5e-b58a-3e22-8987-b32b630a60f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "24d7caea-8824-3fe4-b916-a005a04e6198",
                        "source_sense_description": "(stenen) gewelf of de ruimte onder een gewelf",
                        "target_lang_word": "haunch",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "haunch",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d9adc16-6a8b-36f2-b944-cbf4317bf02f",
                                        "entry_id": "d3496c41-ecb8-3754-aead-06dd2ffb8d2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The area encompassing the upper thigh, hip and buttocks on one side of a human, primate, or quadruped animal, especially one that can sit on its hindquarters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87101a41-1137-4e51-8615-61829c2d3127",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9adc16-6a8b-36f2-b944-cbf4317bf02f",
                                                "text": "But I had no time to pursue these reflections; for the gray horse came to the door, and made me a sign to follow him into the third room where I saw a very comely mare, together with a colt and foal, sitting on their haunches upon mats of straw, not unartfully made, and perfectly neat and clean."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f0729e7-8e5e-45d8-be16-486f2a16e1e9",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9adc16-6a8b-36f2-b944-cbf4317bf02f",
                                                "text": "And the rabbit from his path-way\nLeaped aside, and at a distance\nSat erect upon his haunches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "528ad6f2-ee3e-448f-b71e-f981ea466fef",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9adc16-6a8b-36f2-b944-cbf4317bf02f",
                                                "text": "While Heracles, - the thews and cordage of his thighs\nStraitened and strained beyond the utmost stretch\nFrom quivering heel to haunch like sweating hawsers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bff968cf-84dc-4b60-8772-4f53dbcea41c",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9adc16-6a8b-36f2-b944-cbf4317bf02f",
                                                "text": "The fog comes on little cat feet.\nIt sits looking over harbor and city\non silent haunches and then moves on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "591ec99a-e725-4ef3-a140-6421319ae8b1",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9adc16-6a8b-36f2-b944-cbf4317bf02f",
                                                "text": "He [Novak Djokovic] dropped to his haunches just inside the baseline as Centre Court rose to acclaim the champion, hugging South African [Kevin] Anderson at the net before skipping over towards his box and celebrating wildly in front of his coaching team and wife Jelena."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbb75ac7-0175-3300-a4b9-f15706f17747",
                                        "entry_id": "d3496c41-ecb8-3754-aead-06dd2ffb8d2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The loin and leg of a quadruped, especially when used as food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9508a742-fcfc-4e0c-9a8e-42f3979455fe",
                                                "sense_id": "bbb75ac7-0175-3300-a4b9-f15706f17747",
                                                "text": "Now these are the Laws of the Jungle, and many and mighty are they; / But the head and the hoof of the Law and the haunch and the hump is—Obey!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a05b2497-9de5-49e3-829a-d56c83364648",
                                                "sense_id": "bbb75ac7-0175-3300-a4b9-f15706f17747",
                                                "text": "On the rough-hewn oaken table the venison haunch was shared."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6984e0b-6288-372a-af28-185722bdf5e3",
                                        "entry_id": "d3496c41-ecb8-3754-aead-06dd2ffb8d2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A squat vertical support structure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "884fc9d1-6811-3ba7-9e9c-5dd1a67dd9bc",
                                        "entry_id": "d3496c41-ecb8-3754-aead-06dd2ffb8d2d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A jerked underhand throw."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
